+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project has no recorded decision on a cache eviction policy. A search of the repository's documentation, changelog, and source code turned up no ADR, policy document, or other recorded decision specifying a cache eviction strategy; the only "cache" references found are implementation details of Gin's per-request query/form value caches, which are not evicted but simply reset at the end of each request.
